  "goodToKnow": "Manuell means manual or by hand: manuell eingeben, eine manuelle Kontrolle, manuelle Schaltung (manual gears). The opposite is automatisch. Manuelle Therapie is a type of physiotherapy often prescribed in Germany. A user manual, though, is die Bedienungsanleitung or das Handbuch. From Latin manus (hand). Stressed on the last syllable: ma-nu-EL. Native synonym: von Hand."
